Package: bazaar
Architecture: any
Depends: appstream,
         dconf-gsettings-backend | gsettings-backend,
         flatpak,
         libbge0 (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: glycin-loaders,
            packagekit
Description: Flatpak app store with Adwaita and GTK4
 Bazaar is an app store for Flatpak applications built with GTK4 and
 libadwaita. It lets you discover, install, update and remove Flatpak apps,
 browse curated and Flathub content, and manage add-ons.
 .
 This BlankOn build also shows pending APT system package updates on the
 Library page and installs them through PackageKit, either on the next
 restart (offline update) or immediately. Install packagekit for this.

Package: libbge0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Library to make GTK Extensions for Bazaar
 Bazaar GTK Extensions (bge) is a small library of GTK4 widgets used by
 Bazaar, the Flatpak app store, such as an animation framework, a carousel
 and a Markdown renderer.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: libbge-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libbge0 (= ${binary:Version}),
         libgtk-4-dev,
         libgtksourceview-5-dev,
         libmd4c-dev,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Library to make GTK Extensions for Bazaar (header files)
 Bazaar GTK Extensions (bge) is a small library of GTK4 widgets used by
 Bazaar, the Flatpak app store, such as an animation framework, a carousel
 and a Markdown renderer.
 .
 This package contains the development files.

